  "title": "Electric mobility: TotalEnergies and Tikehau Capital Join Forces to Develop Public Charging Networks in Belgium and the Netherlands",
  "summary": "Paris, February 4, 2026 – TotalEnergies and Tikehau Capital have announced the creation of a joint investment platform to promote the development of charging infrastructure for electric vehicles in urban public spaces in Belgium and the Netherlands. This partnership will support municipal authorities through the EV transition and consolidate TotalEnergies’ position as a leading player […]",
